      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MADE BLUE (5) skirted wide from an outside draw last start and found the front, leading throughout to win (24.04) at this track in a Maiden over 435m. Great chance to get the job done again. DR. FREDDY (3) shapes as hard to beat after winning last start over the 435m at this track in a good 24.43. Has the ability and looks a key chance. ASTON ARROW (1) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last five runs. Last time finished 3rd on September 27 over 435m at this track behind My Charm beaten 2.75 lengths (24.93) in a Grade 7. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Will give a great sight again. HARD MAN (6) is a last start winner worth following up.",
